      "text": "Topical 5-fluorouracil 1% or 5% cream for flat warts; 17% salicylic acid with 2.5% 5-fluorouracil under tape for plantar warts. Photodynamic therapy with aminolevulinic acid plus salicylic acid is moderately effective for recalcitrant warts (SORT B)"
